        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "** VIRTUAL TOUR AVAILABLE BY REQUEST **\n\nMySherryFitz Online Portal -> To view current offers or place your own offer on this property, please visit SherryFitz.ie and register for your mySherryFitz account.\n\nSherry FitzGerald Gleeson are delighted to present No. 4 Ikerrin Close to the market, comprising a 2-Bed semi-detached bungalow, situated in this most central location on Ikerrin Road and within a short walking distance of the town centre.\n\nAccommodation includes Entrance Hall, large Sitting Room, Kitchen, 2 no. double Bedrooms and a modern Bathroom / Wetroom.\n\nThere is a large driveway to the front, with side access leading to the rear containing a garden shed, boilerhouse and a non-overlooked, maintenance-free yard.\n\nCentral heating is provided by an oil-fired system, there are double glazed windows throughout and all mains services are connected.\n\nThis is a very rare opportunity to acquire a low-maintenance and modern bungalow presented in excellent condition, in a superb location, within walking distance of the town centre, shops (Ely's Centra adjacent), MIC (Mary Immaculate College), Cathedral, cafés, restaurants and all services and amenities.\n\nA virtual tour link can be supplied on request, with in-person viewings strictly by appointment only. Further enquiries can be made by contacting Sole Selling Agents, Sherry FitzGerald Gleeson in Thurles - (0504) 22997.\n\n____________________________________\n\nThese particulars are issued by Sherry FitzGerald Gleeson on the strict understanding that they do not form part of any contract and are provided for guidance purposes only. While every effort has been made to ensure accuracy, no liability is accepted for any errors or omissions. Interested parties should satisfy themselves as to the correctness of the information provided, through inspection or other means. The vendor does not make or give, and neither Sherry FitzGerald Gleeson nor any of its employees has authority to make or give, any representation or warranty in respect of this property. Sherry FitzGerald Gleeson is marketing this property on the basis that all relevant title and certification documents are in place or will be provided by the vendor prior to sale.\n\n____________________________________"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - 1.36m x 1.81m\nWith laminate timber flooring.\n\nLiving Room - 4.36m x 4.50m\nSpacious Living Room with open fire place.\n\nHallway - 1.08m x 4.31m\nwith Stira access to a spacious attic\n\nKitchen - 2.73m 2.75m\nWith fitted Kitchen, laminate timber flooring and plumbed for washing machine / dryer.\n\nBathroom - 1.80m x 2.47m\nWith W.C, W.H.B, electric shower and tiled flooring.\n\nBedroom 1 - 2.76m x 3.97m\nLarge Bedroom with fitted wardrobes and laminate timber flooring.\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.98m x 3.38m\nSpacious Bedroom with access to rear yard"
